# Job (fix, model astra): node ZoneWorld gateway process crashed with an unhandled `ConfigError: disconnect_rid failed: No such file or directory` (code 706, errno 2) thrown from `RawStreamSessionService.deliver` (`node-raw-mesh-backend.js:1106` → `deliverBoundSession` → `handleIngress` → mesh pump) — the framework asked Core to disconnect a STREAM session RID that Core no longer had and treated NOT_FOUND as fatal, killing the process ("gateway exited before the sample client ran", cleanup SIGKILL of zone nodes)

You are a codex sub-agent under a Claude supervisor. Read `AGENTS.md` §3/§4, `framework/AGENTS.md`, `core/doc/spec/core/socket/README.ko.md` § zlink_disconnect_rid (returns
`ZLINK_CONNECT_NOT_FOUND` when the target is absent — a terminal fact, not an error to retry) and §6, `04-session/01-stream-session.ko.md` (session lifecycle, session-gone
handling), `bindings/doc/spec/node/README.ko.md` (ConfigError/result 706 mapping), and the recent node STREAM commits (`8159b15752` STREAM async terminal, `9981c9fd6e`).
